    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38453132d44b6d8891a0c518",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "旺紫丁",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bd13b5e1395ea87340cd1c102f7f659c57ca9664b7ec0b998ebc201a2149beb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        62,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/62/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b5f14b8d5e3277decdd01e5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "证明咱是当真能成为“明星”的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c79add538f7ee235a3c326dfe54af56decfb07b4a5dead06f71aa8983fab0976",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        62,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/62/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7a653756d7303fb3082f312",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天与迷人景致的并跑本意是为了\n一路顺利的旺紫丁构筑一堵具体的高墙。",
      "source_fingerprint": "308beb6371983e63784c6880b7a304569c31fba1c6744589b9780b05a9db84f3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        63,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/63/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5bbf7fc27dd8cc87cb84d9b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我也重新认识到紫丁的长处了啊",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ed64084ab781984edebf95303baf9e35e10f09877c214f9642694030f140892",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        64,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/64/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95e0d1a250751a57fd9e8058",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我也重新认识到紫丁的长处了啊",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ed64084ab781984edebf95303baf9e35e10f09877c214f9642694030f140892",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        64,
        "choice_data_list",
        1
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/64/choice_data_list/1"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f860f60c658c998dc8e81c8d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "本想着迷人景致能以别于黄金巨匠的形式\n展现高远的境界，没想到效果出奇的好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f148f0540a9be22c715fe5387a94851ca34d5e1aaa0d73313832c26fa24db2f6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        64,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/64/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83c6203edca94341dc4fb0d6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "旺紫丁",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bd13b5e1395ea87340cd1c102f7f659c57ca9664b7ec0b998ebc201a2149beb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        65,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/65/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e787f3048acc06d9bf8c4881",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "咱的、长处吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cf4ad36483047780bde781f75cd24cebd6afaa29350c97f48eaecd10a36f3f2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        65,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/65/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de3ab46efed1cff9c0a14769",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "领教强者的真章无异于一剂猛药。\n切身体会到差距后，原本顺利的步调\n也可能就此停滞。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c0d716ec877dc805ece06be418b100a2176a8e9235091008633910e2d9dea13",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        66,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/66/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec8d1a5698396f4271492007",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但旺紫丁并未这样。\n她直面高墙、咀嚼自身的不足，\n仍选择无所畏惧地发起挑战――",
      "source_fingerprint": "61b5773b1775f686c65f232738fbb3de28f3e909a5730574dc3511525784b618",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        67,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/67/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f14b1bdced13202479cc1f91",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你果然、是冲紫丁呀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ae4577acf23ffc7d343724b09508f9bbc678176cb2929685eb8ad8ec5d8b661",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        68,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/68/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32ed17326907124b9de598e5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你果然、是冲紫丁呀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ae4577acf23ffc7d343724b09508f9bbc678176cb2929685eb8ad8ec5d8b661",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        68,
        "choice_data_list",
        1
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/68/choice_data_list/1"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f0c411e1d2e0593a88827b2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "向强者、向自身极限，\n选择不断发起冲刺（原文也有吐槽的意思）……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b39c277e252458d9b6765d567cb50bdcd84613464586691f7fe26c394e0dc16",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        68,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/68/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:194500a2ac8652095bfb3ba6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "旺紫丁",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bd13b5e1395ea87340cd1c102f7f659c57ca9664b7ec0b998ebc201a2149beb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
