    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4339ab6186ca3af576022aba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……………………咳哼。\n嘛、不过意思咱懂了。\n所以――",
      "source_fingerprint": "e59b0e3d0cdd8a65c05db51be1b81dc213a5e36bd9162252feec6a4185989b81",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        70,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/70/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bc7fe3de9399a1dae3ffcae",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯啊，我会努力做好装（傻）紫丁的！",
