    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcdda71ade4aa42d14090beb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "别瞎起艺名啦！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f978e9cbb9d07fed91ce2182dbedc25d8b7cd6346c6b14183711c778043af9cb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        72,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/72/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75f5ad8cc1d5565dac62d1a9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向『阪神JF』，重整心绪，\n旺紫丁决意冲刺（吐槽）到底――",
      "source_fingerprint": "121b4ae8a5af24f345fcde12018e67d15099e24f943fe39c0764e9dcec0298be",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        73,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/73/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e0cdc9ccb82dec55b545ce6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "稍胜旁人些许还远远不及。\n必须攀登向更高的峰顶。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab04cd3b1603bce609affa96ddbfb7efec044636669aa643e0c3d5a801aee537",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6e49079dc62d1a81ff0bc75",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要成为跨越世代仍被传颂的，\n超乎常规的存在。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdf319757bd37e7fce98c7d3ca7796f05457776821ab350578571368302d31d0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130113.json",
