    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e781b50f21dcb968e27558c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "仰望的天空虽高远",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ca7deed8f839b2a6669b1998f10b60966c316b46af7e3738705db86e4d9f3e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:597bfd9f46248a683d1db1a1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "杏目出战『日本杯』当天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d263033e2505db7f90e33303dca0be3a06a71b1dec3fd115fb80a4025a0ee03",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f58e91a5e81285e0baa938a6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我和旺紫丁一起来到现场观战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ba70f39b5e596587628cb0cb06a0c7519ca5aacea4df4b90b0acc7317906911",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ecd16ecca12d4ed0a522cf4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "实况",
      "source_fingerprint": "50349a592c466fb97eeafeb81fd3fa65c8c3b2e779463937300c4c8f97230140",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2763d5a570cdd47b2dd8874a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好，各选手进入闸门。\n比赛马上就要开始――",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb4f2c1137aca8be5e8185eb1bf42db91b6d0ec259793d86ac6a1ba57d36d7f9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b59f3795eb81dbbeedc6e396",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "黄金巨匠以自己正是“王”的自我为自信，\n在霸道上一往无前。",
      "source_fingerprint": "96c5df6695d448b656e2bd614535fbe1301c65a79f67d52f5b51711892d57151",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        100,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/100/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4943fda4a915b52f03f5847",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "并非是由谁给予的。\n而是自己觉得、“自己应有的模样”――",
      "source_fingerprint": "598800925b67ff5584046b461db3919213bfe2633a7efa9089024c11df5bcdcd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        101,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/101/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68ecb91b47e4cfa4996eae8a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对此的信念才是伟业的原动力。\n……我是这样理解黄金巨匠的话的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8b64b28a6a5d958f67dc84acedbc84f52c19e4d81fdea395387b3ad0d9319d4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        102,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/102/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abf7548fb91b4e68ef360796",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要是旺紫丁也有这种“自己应有的模样”的话，\n说不定就能凭自信前进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "311e668aae95a5532adf9b664c84cb158772a6226d23ea528a491a6b0e9190b8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        103,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/103/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa8e225eeeedf1fd4d7d6b53",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（“女王”啊）",
      "source_fingerprint": "b77f97467acf5dd14ff31b954df2039b0f3c7bf3e4b6d03e0a480963207ea32a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        104,
